    "durationMs": 174062,
    "finalText": "Implementation complete. All 16 tests pass and the API verified end-to-end against the live MySQL database.\n\nWhat I built:\n\n- **Migration** — `links` table with unique `code` (string), `url` varchar(2048), `clicks` counter defaulting to 0\n- **`Link` model** — Laravel 13 `#[Fillable]` attribute style, integer-cast `clicks`, plus a factory\n- **`LinkController`** — POST `/links` (generates an 8-char code when omitted, 409 on duplicate custom code with a unique-index race safety net), GET `/links/{code}`, GET `/r/{code}` (atomic `increment('clicks')` then 302 with the exact stored URL), GET `/links` ordered by id ascending with `items` + `total`\n- **Routes** — `routes/api.php` registered with `apiPrefix: ''` in `bootstrap/app.php`, so paths are `/links` and `/r/{code}`; exceptions always render as JSON, with `error`-field responses for 422 validation and 404s\n- **Validation** — `url` requires an absolute http/https URL with host; `code` must match `[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}`; malformed JSON falls through to the required-url 422\n- **Persistence** — reads DB settings from the `DB_*` environment variables (verified against the provided MySQL `bench` database); clicks and rows survived a full server restart\n- **`start.sh`** — executable, runs `php artisan migrate --force` then `exec php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload` in the foreground\n- **README** — added a start/endpoints/tests section\n- **Tests** — 14 feature tests covering every requirement (run on isolated sqlite via forced phpunit env so shell env vars can't leak in)\n\nOne gotcha worth noting: the response initially returned `\"clicks\": null` after create because Laravel 13's `#[Fillable(['code', 'url'])]` silently dropped the mass-assigned default — adding `clicks` to fillable fixed it. I also truncated the `links` table after my curl verification, so the automated suite starts with an empty database and no running server conflicts."
  }
